# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# v5.22.15 — secret containment. The repo is PUBLIC (github.com/dblagbro/
# llm-proxy-manager); the 2026-08-28 audit found two WORKING credentials had
# been published. `.env` alone was not enough: it does not cover `.env.local`
# or `.env.prod`, and nothing covered the SQLite DB, which holds API key
# hashes, encrypted raw keys, provider API keys and OAuth refresh tokens.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Env files — every variant, keeping the checked-in template
.env.*
!.env.example

# Key material
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
credentials.json
service-account*.json

# Databases and dumps — llmproxy.db carries key hashes, encrypted_key
# blobs and OAuth refresh tokens. Never commit one.
data/
backups/
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.bak
*.dump
